; Rows bottom to top use power 30, 45, 60, 75, 90 % of S1000.
; Each square is 6 mm and filled with lines 0.080 mm apart.
; Set work zero at the lower-left corner of a painted scrap piece at least 42 x 42 mm.
; Wear laser eye protection. Ventilate.
